# still to write for itself; printed at every load; the act`s suite holds them empty at its seal.
#⟪PENDING checks ⟫
#⟪PENDING citation ⟫
#⟪PENDING closing ⟫
#⟪PENDING record ⟫
#⟪PENDING reg_gate ⟫
